+// never learns it is braked. FCA11 has the camera's own stop-hold lane - FCA_StopReq (bit 21) + CF_VSM_HBACmd (bits 1-2) -
+// which asks the ESC for ITS OWN hold. Until 0033 the production hook refused both bits unconditionally. They are now
+// accepted ONLY as the exact pair (HBACmd == 1 AND StopReq == 1) on a frame that satisfies every one of:
