+//       FCA11_CRAWL_MIN_LSB in the law). A stop request with no pressure behind it is refused;
+//   (3) EVERY wheel is at or below walking pace: the FASTEST wheel (hyundai_fca11_long_speed_max, fresh <= 100 ms via the
+//       window) <= HYUNDAI_FCA11_ROLL_MIN_SPEED (160 raw = 5 km/h). The fastest wheel, not the slowest: one stuck/zero
+//       wheel must never make a road-speed frame look stopped. A stop hold is never legal at road speed;
+//   (4) the camera does not own FCA11 (hyundai_fca11_long_cam_brake keeps absolute priority: while the camera is braking
