+      // window (see HYUNDAI_FCA11_LONG_STOP_HOLD_MIN_DEC), CF_VSM_DecCmdAct,
       // Warn 1/2 (never a shape this car answered), Warn 3 on a passive frame (a warning we have no reason to send),
